WEBVTT

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.580
Ah! My Goddess
Flights of Fancy

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:23.110
In this wide world

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:28.290
People you're meant to meet can be seen

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:34.860
Beyond the window, beyond the rainbow

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:38.490
I think you're aware of them

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:45.610
Take off that restrictive weight

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:48.580
Let your feelings go

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:55.890
Now keep your ears open and wait for that time

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:58.650
Awaken now

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:11.930
Cherish the little dream you've
drawn in the vast sky

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:19.210
If you do, you can always become happy

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:21.980
It's certain

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:26.350
Woh woh

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:38.590
Wow, that's pretty awesome!

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:41.000
I can do this, too.

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.140
What the heck was that for?!

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:49.940
Just wanted to wake you from your trance.

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:51.970
I wasn't in any trance!

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:54.280
Well then what WERE you thinking about?

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.740
Well...

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:07.390
Same as always. You simply can't use
the powers at all, can you?

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:08.720
Oh, get off my case!

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:10.060
Hey, easy now...

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:12.930
Fine! No big deal if I can't use
any of these "powers,"

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:15.230
not as long as I've got Tatsundo No. 1 here...

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:20.140
Whoa! What the heck are you doing?!

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:22.660
Cut it out, Skuld!

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:24.410
Ooh!

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.860
Big Sister! Welcome home!

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:30.350
I'm back, Skuld!

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.680
I bought you some ice cream.

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:33.980
You did?!

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:37.950
I'll have it ready for you,
so go wash your hands.

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:39.160
Okay!

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:41.280
All right then, I'll be in the living room.

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:46.750
Big Sister looks like she's enjoying that...

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:50.560
I wonder if riding a bike is fun.

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:55.340
I think I'd like to ride one, too!

00:02:55.810 --> 00:03:01.740
Ah! Let Those Feelings Awaken!

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:05.250
Hmm... So when you turn this crank,

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.050
the power is transferred to the rear
wheel via the chain, right?

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:10.750
And when you grip the lever
connected to the handlebar,

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:14.590
it pulls on a wire, which engages
the brake. I get it...

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:19.330
And it's got springs underneath the seat to
make up for the lack of shock absorbers, huh?

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:25.030
This joint could have been thought out better,
but it's still a simple and logical design.

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:27.370
You want to know how to ride a bike?

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:30.810
N-No, not really!

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.770
I'm not jealous of you at all.

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:34.170
Oh?

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:36.540
Not you, too, Big Sister...

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:42.590
I was examining it purely out of
scientific interest, make no mistake...

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:46.180
Oh, sure! 'Cuz after all, you don't
even know how to ride a bike.

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:51.690
W-What's your problem? Then I guess
this means you CAN ride one, huh?

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:55.430
Well, of course! Let's not assume I'm
like certain OTHER individuals.

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:58.100
Heck, there's nothing I can't do!

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.940
You're lying! It's so obvious.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:03.210
Then what'll you do if I can ride it?

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:07.210
I'll give you ALL the ice cream
Big Sister bought for me!

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:08.840
You mean it?

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:12.840
Y-Yeah...

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:19.650
My, this looks so good! Thanks!

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:23.560
Mmm... How yummy!

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:26.330
I totally believe they used 80% milk in this.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.560
What is the matter with you?!

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:29.830
Don't get such a big head just
because you can ride a bike!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:32.400
I can do whatever I put my mind to also!

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:33.700
Oh yeah?

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:37.140
Okay, then if you can't ride
a bike in three days time,

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:40.070
then you've gotta do three laps
around town riding a tricycle.

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:45.950
Fine! And if I CAN do it, then you've gotta ride
three laps around town on a unicycle!

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:47.250
All right?

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:48.780
SHOCK!

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.420
SHOCK!
Sh-She went for it?!

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:51.050
Sh-She went for it?!

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:53.080
A goddess means what she says.

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:57.050
It's you we're talking about, so I figure
you'll lose interest right away.

00:04:57.260 --> 00:05:01.260
Take it easy! If you start practicing now,
you'll be just fine.

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:04.300
Don't brush it off like that just 'cuz
it's someone else's problem!

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.640
My life is on the line here!

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:08.440
I'll help, too.

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:10.910
Let's practice so that we can
both ride together.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.880
You got it, Big Sister!

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:16.110
Whoa, now wait a minute...

00:05:16.110 --> 00:05:17.580
Let's give it our best shot.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.520
Having Big Sister on my side makes me
a hundred times more confident!

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:23.010
Victory is as good as mine!

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:26.660
This is makin' me sick...

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:29.350
She can change her mood
at the drop of a hat.

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:32.900
Let's take our time and not rush this, okay?

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:34.690
Okay, Big Sister!

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:38.260
I'm sure you'll be able to ride it in no time!

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:40.440
What do you think? Can you do it?

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.170
Uh, what are you doing anyway?

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:43.170
Huh?

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:45.840
There's no need for you to hold me up!

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:50.570
Riding a bike is a small feat for
a great genius such as me!

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.080
No good?!

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:04.060
You see that? These are my special
active elbow protectors!

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:05.920
As long as I've got these...

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:10.000
Whoa... what the?!

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:18.170
Well, I had the right idea.

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:22.340
Hmm... if these can't restore my balance
once I've lost it, then...

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:24.650
Why not just practice like normal?

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:25.780
I've got it!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:28.620
All I need is to attach some support
wheels to the sides of the bike!

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:30.590
Well, that's all right, but usually...

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:35.290
those are what they use on kids' bikes.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:38.320
Okay, fine! I'll go all out!

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:43.870
I've added a gyro-equipped auto-balancer
system and beefed up shock absorbers,

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:47.430
and I gave it power to cope
with the added weight!

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:51.510
It's perfect now!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.980
I think you'll need a license to
drive something like that...

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:57.480
Don't you worry. I'll manage
just fine without it.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:00.970
The issue isn't whether you
can MANAGE or not...

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:04.050
WHOA, STOP!

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.650
Well I'll be. She's still at it.

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:16.100
Just keep it up. Keep it up!

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:17.830
All right, already!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:23.140
Ohh, I just can't do this without any help!

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:28.400
It'll be all right. You see, bicycles
are tons of fun to ride!

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:30.100
Big Sister?

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:36.140
I want you to give this your all so that
we can ride bikes together.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:39.880
Yeah, that's right. That's what I want, too!

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.060
So let's do our best then, okay?

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:45.520
You bet I will! Because I've got you with me!

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:48.030
What are you gawking at, Keiichi?

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.370
Prop me up from the back like
you're supposed to!

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:51.390
Yes, ma'am...

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:54.070
Hey, watch those hands!

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:57.970
What else am I supposed to do?
There's nothing else I can hold on to!

00:07:57.970 --> 00:07:59.980
Just keep your eyes ahead and drive.

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:03.410
Good grief! Well, if you try
anything else, you're in for it!

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:07.840
That's it. Push those pedals!
Relax your shoulders more.

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.590
What're you doing?!

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:14.820
Just pedal!

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:16.120
Keep on going like you are!

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:18.890
Easier said than done!

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:21.660
Big Sister! Help!

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:29.870
Big Sister... didn't help me?

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:31.930
Are you okay, Skuld?

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:35.440
You're not hurt then, are you?
That's a relief!

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:37.670
Come on. Let's do it once more.

00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:42.740
That was really good for a first try,
so you'll be fine the next time.

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.650
O-Okay...

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:47.320
Guess it was just my imagination.

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:50.990
Maybe I let go a little too early.

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:53.430
Make sure you hold on right this time!

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:58.830
You knew, didn't you, Keiichi?

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:02.460
Yeah. That was my plan, too,
right from the start.

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:05.000
Thank you, Keiichi.

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:08.780
Sorry about that!

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:10.270
Ouch...

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:13.320
Big Sister! You didn't help me
this time either...

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.610
Let's give it another try.

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:20.120
This has to be some kind of mistake...

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:23.720
Big Sister not helping me is simply...

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:25.950
She just wouldn't do that.

00:09:26.430 --> 00:09:27.700
She wouldn't be like that.

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:30.830
You've improved a heck of a lot
since you started out.

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:32.630
Come on, once more.

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.040
Why?

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:38.810
Why won't you help me?

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:42.710
Because this practice...
is so that you can ride on your own.

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:47.550
But, falling down hurts! This is really hard!

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:49.710
You still need to give it your best shot.

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:51.520
Big Sister...

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:55.490
Then I guess I will put on that
auto-balancer after all! And then...

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:56.920
That won't do.

00:09:57.230 --> 00:09:58.590
Why?

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:01.860
Because I want you to ride on your own.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:07.840
You see, bicycles are one of the
few things you can ride,

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:10.130
that allow you to interact directly
with the dancing winds.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:14.000
Sometimes the wind is rough,
and sometimes it's gentle and calm.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:18.810
And you'll understand how its thickness
varies with the ever-changing seasons.

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:21.310
For example, it's spring now.

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:26.390
The breath of life, which had been
at rest during the icy months,

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:30.350
becomes greater little by little.
Life spreads out everywhere.

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:31.660
That's why...

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:32.390
I can feel the breeze
That's why...

00:10:32.390 --> 00:10:34.330
I can feel the breeze

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:39.230
and see the scenery without
pedaling on my own...

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:41.640
But this is a different sort of pleasure.

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:44.440
The pleasure comes from being able
to interact with your own legs.

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:46.100
I don't care about that!

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:48.670
Skuld...

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.580
You don't get it!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:55.980
You can ride perfectly fine, so you
don't know how it feels to fall off!

00:10:57.250 --> 00:10:59.660
I'll be able to ride as soon as I reengineer it.

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:01.660
I'm not asking for any more than that.

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:03.020
I'm done with this!

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:06.600
Maybe we were a little too hard on her?

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:08.200
Not really.

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:14.260
The trouble with Skuld is that she relies on
things to do the work for her, just like now.

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:17.060
She has to learn...

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:21.800
that the true pleasure is hers to enjoy
once she gets beyond the pain.

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:25.010
Good grief...

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:27.310
Gave up just like I thought, did she?

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:41.620
What's so great about bicycles anyway?

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:48.060
Goddesses don't need to be able to ride bikes!

00:11:56.280 --> 00:11:57.710
Beautiful...

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:22.360
Hey... Are you okay?

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:24.300
Ouch...

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:29.180
Yeah, yeah, I'm fine. I just jumped
a little too high there.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:32.370
No, it was the bike, not you!

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:33.820
Huh?

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:38.650
Oh, sheesh... it's all beaten up!

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:40.420
That doesn't affect how it rides.

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:43.050
I pity the bike if that's how you feel!

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:45.730
Just leave it there when you're done.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:46.690
Okay!

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:50.070
The chain looks a little loose.
I'll tighten it up.

00:12:50.070 --> 00:12:52.500
Wow... that's pretty cool.

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:55.230
You need to keep it tuned up right.

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:57.900
You've gotta take better care of it.

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:02.440
So you like bikes?

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:04.570
I hate them.

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:14.560
Sheesh, she can be a real handful.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:17.020
All because she can't ride a bike...

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:21.490
It should be better now. See how that feels.

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:22.430
Sure!

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:29.040
It feels way more responsive!

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:34.380
I'll bet! Since the chain was loose, it wasn't
transferring all the power it could.

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:37.170
Wow. I didn't know it could make
such a difference!

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:44.250
Amazing... He's like the wind!

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:45.780
I wish I could do that.

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:48.720
Yeah, it's definitely better now!

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:51.890
Well, of course. Hey, who do you think I am?

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:57.160
Who you are... Actually, I never
did ask your name.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:01.800
My name's Sentaro Kawanishi.
What's yours?

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:05.670
Skuld!

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:08.170
I see. Skuld, huh?

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:09.910
Well, thanks.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:12.780
Huh? What's that for?

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:16.180
What's it... Well, I guess 'cuz
I appreciate it...

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:18.620
And it's what you do when you
meet someone... isn't it?

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:21.180
Uh, I don't know.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:29.900
I-It's not like I fixed it just for you.

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:32.770
It's just... I was a little
concerned about it.

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:34.640
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:39.710
Yeah, but thanks to you I think I might be
able to win this race that's coming up.

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:40.640
Race?

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:45.110
Yeah, it's right around the corner.
It's a pretty big event, too.

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:47.020
Huh, I see...

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:50.520
Well, the gears are worn, too, so we'll
have to go over them, too.

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:51.540
Sure.

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:53.910
Hey...

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:55.460
What?

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:59.120
So do you really hate bicycles?

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:05.890
Fixing a bike even though you don't
know how to ride one, huh?

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:08.900
U-Urd!

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:12.810
Even if you do fix it, you won't
be able to ride it. How sad.

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:16.880
Sh-Shut up! What are you
doing here anyway?!

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:20.550
I won a free ice pop, and I was just
on my way back from getting it.

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:23.150
Then go back! Now!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.350
Yes, ma'am!

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:29.120
I'll get that tricycle ready for you,
so you come home soon, too.

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:32.690
Y-You should go get YOUR
unicycle ready instead!

00:15:32.690 --> 00:15:35.060
Can't you ride a bike, Skuld?

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:39.290
No...

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:46.680
If she loses him as a coach,
she really will be riding that trike.

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:48.440
Now give it your best.

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:52.670
Huh... And that's why you left
and came here, huh?

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:57.490
Well, my big sister wouldn't
help me, and falling hurt...

00:15:57.490 --> 00:15:59.680
Well, of course it hurts!

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:03.490
People like you and my big sister,
who know how to ride,

00:16:03.490 --> 00:16:05.930
wouldn't understand how I feel!

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:08.630
Look! Just look at all the bruises I've got!

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:17.470
What's the deal?

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:20.780
I'm sure I've got as many bruises
as you, if not more!

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:21.910
But, still!

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:24.910
I think what makes bikes fun is
that they will fall over,

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:27.140
but you control them so that they don't.

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:31.380
There's no fun in riding something
that won't ever fall over.

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:36.830
What the heck is that supposed to mean?
It doesn't make any sense!

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:37.930
It doesn't?

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.050
No way!

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:44.700
Well, don't worry about the details.
Have you got some time now?

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:46.030
Well, I guess...

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:48.400
Okay, then come hang out with me for a bit!

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:00.780
I'm back.

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:02.410
Welcome home.

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:04.720
Say, do we have any unicycles lying around?

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:05.720
Huh?

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:06.990
One other thing...

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:10.820
Skuld was wondering if you wanted
to go cycling with her.

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:17.730
I'm telling you it doesn't matter
how many times I do it!

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:20.030
It's all right. You just pedal.

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:21.240
But...

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:22.770
Don't worry.

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.710
Okay, off we go!

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:29.540
Pedal, Skuld! Quick!

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:30.810
But I can't do!

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:31.150
Just do it!
But I can't do!

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:32.080
Just do it!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:41.290
Good... Engine output at 80%.
Engine No. 1 fire!

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:44.550
Engine No. 1? Uh, what?

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:49.730
Still... I'm riding a bicycle!

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:52.530
Time for the slalom!

00:17:57.440 --> 00:17:59.410
Wow, that's awesome!

00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:30.070
Well? Having fun?

00:18:30.070 --> 00:18:32.040
Yeah, this IS fun!

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:36.780
Hey, is it all right...
if we go a little farther?

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:38.810
Sure. But...

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:40.940
It's more fun to ride on your own!

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:43.420
W-Whoa, what are you doing?!

00:18:43.420 --> 00:18:45.620
Don't give up! Now pedal!

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:47.690
Huh?! B-But...

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:49.220
Don't look back!

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:50.230
But...

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:53.850
If you keep on relying on others,
you'll never learn how to ride!

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:57.560
It's okay if you fall. Just pedal!

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:11.680
I did it! I can ride, Sentaro!

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.400
Way to go, Skuld!

00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:17.840
It's true. Riding on your own IS awesome!

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:19.510
Huh?

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:23.260
But this is a different sort of pleasure.

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:26.390
The pleasure comes from being able
to interact with your own legs.

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:29.460
I get it.

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:31.930
I see what she was trying to say.

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:34.670
I'm gonna take your bike for
a little spin, okay?

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:36.000
You bet!

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:39.530
Uh...

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:46.140
I'm sorry, Big Sister.
I'm gonna turn over a new leaf!

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:49.880
I won't give up on things so quickly.

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:52.550
I won't rely on other things so much.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:57.090
I'll give it my all until I'm able to do it on...

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:58.560
my...

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:03.830
OWN...

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:10.340
Big Sister, I'm gonna give up this
turning over a new leaf after all...

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:24.610
I can't go any... farther...

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:28.650
Big Sister!

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:34.890
Urd had said that she was by the riverbank...

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:43.270
Big Sister!

00:20:48.480 --> 00:20:49.700
Skuld!

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:52.600
Big Sister...

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:56.050
Big Sister!

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:02.750
You were able to find the true path after all.

00:21:03.390 --> 00:21:07.190
It's all right now that you understand
what a pleasure it is.

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:11.770
Now stay still for just a moment, okay?

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:12.600
Okay.

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:16.840
There.

00:21:16.840 --> 00:21:19.240
Huh? It doesn't hurt anymore!

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:22.540
Sentaro, I'll give this back to you now.

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:23.810
Right.

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:26.410
U-Um...

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:29.240
Uh...

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:30.820
What's up?

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:34.110
Th-Thanks.

00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:36.060
What's that for?

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:39.490
It's because I appreciate it...
or whatever...

00:21:39.490 --> 00:21:41.390
You did the same thing, right?

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:43.060
Oh, right.

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:54.260
Uh, well... l-I'm gonna go
practice my riding some!

00:22:10.530 --> 00:22:12.020
Skuld...

00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:17.230
Caring about people is what gives
goddesses their strength.

00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:21.100
Could it be?

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:34.650
Whenever one day ends

00:22:34.650 --> 00:22:47.630
"I loved you again today,"
I think quietly in my heart

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:51.770
When I think back, you see

00:22:51.770 --> 00:22:57.140
There were days when I
wore myself out crying

00:22:57.140 --> 00:23:05.980
But the place we reached after I
survived many such nights

00:23:05.980 --> 00:23:10.390
And the story that began

00:23:10.390 --> 00:23:16.690
Is real in a somehow dreamlike way

00:23:16.690 --> 00:23:24.970
Premonitions of immeasurable love
were certainly overflowing

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:35.540
From our clasped hands even as we
laughed bashfully a little

00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:45.020
After all, beyond a doubt,
undeniably, you and I

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:50.050
Are in love with each other

00:23:55.530 --> 00:23:57.530
Ooh, look! It's my angel!

00:23:57.530 --> 00:23:59.870
I guess this means you're a
bonafide goddess now, huh?

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:01.340
So what can she do?

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:02.600
Um, well...

00:24:02.600 --> 00:24:04.540
Next time, "Ah! My Darling Cupid!"

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:05.040
Ah! My Darling Cupid!
Next time, "Ah! My Darling Cupid!"

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:07.040
Ah! My Darling Cupid!
I wonder if she's made any moves on Sentaro.

00:24:07.040 --> 00:24:09.210
Ah! My Darling Cupid!
I heard they both rode to the next town over.

00:24:09.210 --> 00:24:09.470
Ah! My Darling Cupid!
